# MU Weather needs NO API keys to run — all weather data comes from
# keyless public APIs (Open-Meteo forecast/archive/air-quality, MET Norway,
# MeteoAlarm). The app itself reads no environment variables.
#
# The only variable ever used in this repo is the EAS CLI token below.
# It is optional: it is only needed for automated Expo Application Services
# builds (CI). For normal development, run `eas login` instead and you do
# not need this file at all.

EXPO_TOKEN=
